{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UJUVxrHNf8YC2ReaxHsJgS","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/cert_manip_resist_eval/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-22\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- plan001_step1_batched_v2（准备中）\\\\n- plan001_step1_batched（准备中）\\\\n- plan001_step1_v3（准备中）\\\\n- plan001_step1_throttled_v5（准备中）\\\\n- plan001_step1_throttled_v4（准备中）\\\\n- plan001_step1_throttled_v3（准备中）\\\\n- plan001_step1_throttled_v2（准备中）\\\\n- plan001_step1_throttled（准备中）\\\\n- plan001_step1_v2（准备中）\\\\n- plan001_step1_parallel_final（准备中）\\\\n- …另有 13 项\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **plan001_step1_full_v4** (success): Expanding from 6 to 15 models (9 API + 6 local) across 6 families and 3 capability tiers breaks the structural K_eff-η_max collinearity (r=-0.8 with 6 models). With 15 models, panels can have high K_eff (cross-family diversity) without necessarily including weak judges, enabling clean separation of diversity vs robustness effects.\\\\n- **taxonomy-broad-spectrum** (negative): K_eff is a significant negative predictor of panel ASR specifically for broad-spectrum attacks (verbosity bias, position bias, authority bias) that exploit shared judge biases, consistent across both MMLU and ARC datasets. This validates the attack taxonomy: targeted attacks → η_max dominates; broad-spectrum attacks → K_eff provides additional protection. ← 基于 mvp-step2v3-retry3\\\\n- **mvp-step2v3-retry3** (negative): Controlling for individual model robustness (η_max), higher K_eff panels have significantly lower ASR. Multi-factor regression log(ASR) ~ log(K_eff) + log(η_max) should show K_eff coefficient significantly negative. ← 基于 mvp-step2v3-retry2\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 1 / 负向 3 / 失败 3 / 共 7\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nseetacloud-rtx6000: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp-step2v3-regression: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp-step2v3-retry: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp-step2v3-retry2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1736, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01L1oPt8oD5UdbSVG2S3hKbY","session_id":"2e1da424-d161-46f8-8a38-0f3a6ee07afa","uuid":"4b1f77f4-dd40-4526-9f1d-4ff245d92d41","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:57:35.581Z"}
