{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019nfr9GkWu9AkuCMvue7rCE","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tPlan 009 VIF Multicollinearity Analysis Results\n2\t\n3\tServer path: /root/cert_manip_resist_eval/artifacts/results/results_plan009_vif_analysis.json\n4\t\n5\tSummary:\n6\t- Mean VIF(K_eff): 2.9943 (range 1.01-10.02)\n7\t- K_eff residualized significant: 1/12 (only arc_challenge×sycophancy)\n8\t- η_max Bonferroni significant: 3/12\n9\t- η_max FDR significant: 6/12\n10\t- Beta vs OLS concordance: 11/12\n11\t\n12\tKey findings:\n13\t1. VIF mostly 1.0-5.4 (acceptable), one outlier arc_challenge×position_bias VIF=10.02\n14\t2. Residualized K_eff confirms non-significance is NOT collinearity artifact\n15\t3. η_max survives strict multiple testing correction (Bonferroni 3/12, FDR 6/12)\n16\t4. Beta regression agrees with OLS in 11/12 conditions — conclusions robust\n17\t5. arc_challenge×sycophancy remains the sole K_eff exception (partial r=-0.64, p=0.002)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01L1oPt8oD5UdbSVG2S3hKbY","session_id":"2e1da424-d161-46f8-8a38-0f3a6ee07afa","uuid":"47d1765f-8b28-49da-8dbc-1232500745d8","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:58:40.917Z"}
